# Optional: your own Google Books API key for a separate, higher quota pool.
# Without this, requests share the unauthenticated global pool which can hit daily limits.
#
# To set up:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials
# 2. Create an API key, restrict it to the "Books API"
# 3. Add an HTTP referrer restriction: https://adam3smith.github.io/*
#    (This prevents the key from being usable if someone copies it from source)
# 4. Copy this file to .env and fill in the key — never commit .env to git
#
# VITE_GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=your_key_here
